#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "31\t143"
msgid "Hey.\\nYou really Saejima?"
msgstr "Oye tú.\\n¿Realmente eres Saejima?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "210\t340"
msgid "I asked a fucking question.\\nYou Taiga Saejima or not!?"
msgstr "¡Imbécil, te estoy preguntando si eres Saejima o no!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "395\t453"
msgid "So what if I am?"
msgstr "¿Y qué si lo fuera?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "517\t618"
msgid "Then it looks like there really is a god."
msgstr "Entonces, comenzaría a creer en Dios."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "796\t917"
msgid "This here's some goddamn divine intervention."
msgstr "Porque la suerte nos acaba de sonreír."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "981\t1091"
msgid "You realize who we are, don't you?"
msgstr "Ya sabes quiénes somos, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1204\t1268"
msgid "The Ueno Seiwa."
msgstr "El Ueno Seiwa."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1287\t1468"
msgid "Our boss was one of the men\\nyou murdered those twenty-five years ago."
msgstr "¡Mi jefe era parte del Ueno Seiwa,\\nfue uno de los que mataste hace veinticinco años!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1543\t1652"
msgid "We've had you in our sights for decades now."
msgstr "Hemos estado esperando por este día."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1674\t1771"
msgid "And here you are right on our doorstep."
msgstr "Desde que lo mataste, todos estos malditos años."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1810\t1920"
msgid "So ya want a little payback for your boss."
msgstr "Y supongo que esto es una venganza por haber matado a tu jefe."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "1964\t2041"
msgid "Nothing little about it."
msgstr "No es tan simple como eso."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2056\t2216"
msgid "After the hell you put us all through,\\nwe want revenge!"
msgstr "¡Esto es una venganza por haber\\narruinado nuestras vidas!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2353\t2437"
msgid "So we're gonna do the prison a favor."
msgstr "Ya no será necesario que te apliquen la pena de muerte."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu
msgctxt "2448\t2591"
msgid "You're getting executed here and now!"
msgstr "¡Nosotros nos encargaremos de ejecutarte!"

